WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-08 - Mile High
NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2001: Static and Silence (Book 1)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.500
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:37.231
The air is thin, my head is tight

00:00:54.786 --> 00:00:57.367
Beneath the sharp and western light

00:00:59.848 --> 00:01:02.690
A ghost inside this diesel drone

00:01:04.891 --> 00:01:07.572
A thousand miles, still all alone

00:01:09.913 --> 00:01:12.574
The mountain peaks, a jagged crown

00:01:15.315 --> 00:01:19.800
In this cold and mile-high town

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:25.500
Just want a drink, a piece of bread

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:30.500
But there's a voice inside my head

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:35.800
A mile high, but I'm sinking low

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:40.200
A silent 'no' is all I know

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.006
My stomach's empty, throat is dry

00:01:44.046 --> 00:01:49.500
Beneath a cold Colorado sky

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:54.800
And there's a whisper of a different pain

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:59.500
A secret fire, a burning stain

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.200
I can't say a word, she'll never see

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:09.741
The pieces that are breaking inside me

00:02:20.686 --> 00:02:23.228
Another station, another crowd

00:02:25.808 --> 00:02:28.389
Her angry sighs are getting loud

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.371
We change the bus, a hurried pace

00:02:35.852 --> 00:02:38.413
No kindness in this bitter place

00:02:40.934 --> 00:02:45.500
I watch the others, free to go

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:50.200
A life I'll never get to know

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:54.685
Just bite my tongue and play the part

00:02:56.066 --> 00:03:01.800
And hide the panic in my heart

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:06.800
